<mxfile host="app" agent="nightshift"><diagram name="i1"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1590" pageHeight="920" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="Why not just query the app database?" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=34;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="44" width="1410" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Three things go wrong, and only the first one is obvious." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#6B7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="96" width="1410" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#B91C1C&apos;&gt;YOU COMPETE WITH RIDERS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The report reads millions of rows.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;While it runs, the database has&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;less capacity for the person&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;trying to book a car.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;A slow report is annoying.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;A slow booking screen loses money.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="150" width="410" height="292" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#B91C1C&apos;&gt;THE ANSWER CHANGES&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;Run the same query twice and&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;get two numbers, because rows&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;moved underneath you.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;Nobody can reconcile a report&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;that will not sit still.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="150" width="410" height="264" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#B91C1C&apos;&gt;IT IS THE WRONG SHAPE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The app database is built to&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;answer &apos;where is my driver&apos;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;Not &apos;what did we earn last&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;month, by zone, by rail&apos;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="150" width="410" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="&lt;b&gt;So make a copy.&lt;/b&gt; On our own hardware, on our own clock, shaped for the questions people actually ask. Everything in this course is that one idea, done carefully." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="490" width="1350" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="i2"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1590" pageHeight="940" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="Bronze, silver, gold" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=34;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="44" width="1410" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Three layers. Each one is allowed to do things the one before it was not." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#6B7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="96" width="1410" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1D4ED8&apos;&gt;BRONZE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;A faithful copy of one source.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;No joins. No renames.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;No cleaning. No opinions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;So that &apos;did we break it, or did&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;they send it broken&apos; always&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;has an answer.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF4FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="150" width="410" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#047857&apos;&gt;SILVER&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;One clean row per thing.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;Joins allowed. Unit conversions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;allowed. Dropping what nothing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;uses, allowed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The first table a stranger&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;could read.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="150" width="410" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#B45309&apos;&gt;GOLD&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:19px;color:#111111;line-height:1.45&apos;&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;The answer, at the grain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;somebody asks for.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;One row per day, per zone,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;per whatever the question is.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;If you cannot say the column&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;name to a finance manager,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;margin-top:9px&apos;&gt;it does not belong.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="150" width="410" height="348" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="&lt;b&gt;The names do not matter. The discipline does.&lt;/b&gt; What matters is that each layer has one job, and that you can always walk backwards from a number in gold to the exact row in bronze that produced it, and from there to the source." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="500" width="1350" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="i3"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1120" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="A script, and a pipeline" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=34;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="44" width="940" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Same code, in both. Everything else is different." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#6B7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="96" width="940" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#B91C1C&apos;&gt;A SCRIPT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;run it twice -&gt; double the rows&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;crashes halfway  -&gt; half written&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;bad value        -&gt; crash, or silently dropped&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;did it run?      -&gt; check your memory&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;how long?        -&gt; nobody knows&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="150" width="410" height="244" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#047857&apos;&gt;A PIPELINE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;run it twice -&gt; the same table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;crashes halfway  -&gt; nothing written&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;bad value        -&gt; held, with the reason&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;did it run?      -&gt; a row in teach.runs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;font-family:Courier New;font-size:17px;margin-top:7px&apos;&gt;how long?        -&gt; in that same row&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="150" width="410" height="244" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;Four rules, and they are the whole course.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Idempotent&lt;/b&gt;: running it twice is the same as running it once.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Atomic&lt;/b&gt;: all of it lands, or none of it does.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Honest&lt;/b&gt;: a value you cannot read is held, never dropped and never defaulted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Observable&lt;/b&gt;: every run leaves a row saying what happened." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="510" width="880" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>